      <activity id="f316fb81-4f34-533d-a19c-1c2866b129f7" activityNameId="3a613111-f249-561e-a1f6-d80816e92291" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Sawn timber, softwood, planed, air dried, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Sawn timber, softwood, planed, air dried, at plant
The multi-output process "planing, softwood, air dried, u=20%" delivers the two coproducts "sawn timber, softwood, planed, air dried, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, from planing, softwood, air dried, u=20%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: 7ac6c653-0dae-35fa-88d6-86e4da0d210b
Includes planing process. planing mill is assumed to be located on the sawmill site. No transports are considered. Dust emissions are neglected for a lack of data.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Technology mix used in Germany (1986)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the German technology mix is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7ac6c653-0dae-35fa-88d6-86e4da0d210b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
